WEBVTT

00:00:02.458 --> 00:00:04.750
Wow! He's really fast!

00:00:04.833 --> 00:00:09.458
-It's like he wants us to follow him.
-I'll follow that guy anywhere.

00:00:09.541 --> 00:00:14.125
He's adorable!
I can't wait to show the others.

00:00:14.208 --> 00:00:17.291
If that darned Dreamy Screamy
didn't get broken,

00:00:17.375 --> 00:00:20.791
we could call them over right now.

00:00:22.208 --> 00:00:24.750
Is this what you wanted us to see,
little fella?

00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:28.458
I think it's sick, Mateo. Poor thing.

00:00:28.541 --> 00:00:33.041
Let's get it back to Mr. Oz.
Maybe he can help us figure out--

00:00:33.125 --> 00:00:36.916
This night has been one long fiasco!
Check over there!

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.791
We can't keep losing these eggs
to the Dream Chasers!

00:00:39.875 --> 00:00:41.750
Oh, no. What do we do now?

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:46.583
What do you think, little guy? Can we
fox out again or are you too tired?

00:00:46.666 --> 00:00:48.166
Over here, NK!

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:50.750
I've found some tracks
leading into those bushes.

00:00:50.833 --> 00:00:53.750
I told you not to call me that!
Sheesh!

00:00:53.833 --> 00:00:56.291
Also, good work.

00:00:56.375 --> 00:00:59.291
Come out with your hands up,
Dream Chasers,

00:00:59.375 --> 00:01:02.291
before we turn you into Dreamsand!

00:01:02.375 --> 00:01:07.333
Okay, okay, looks like
you outfoxed us!

00:01:12.125 --> 00:01:15.000
Uh-oh, not good!

00:01:24.208 --> 00:01:25.875
Mateo!

00:01:39.875 --> 00:01:43.791
It looks as if this dream is over.

00:01:43.875 --> 00:01:46.916
-Say goodbye, Mateo.
-And you say goodnight...

00:01:48.833 --> 00:01:51.625
to Mr. Sharky-Tank!

00:01:53.833 --> 00:01:57.500
-What in the Dream World?
-Sic 'em, boy!

00:02:10.541 --> 00:02:13.791
Get in, bro!
We're gonna do some bad guy beating!

00:02:13.875 --> 00:02:15.625
Right on!

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:35.958
Whoo-hoo!

00:02:38.333 --> 00:02:39.583
Check this out!

00:02:41.333 --> 00:02:45.625
Mr. Baby-Sharky-Tank-Nado!
Whoo-hoo-hoo!

00:02:52.875 --> 00:02:55.333
I don't wanna make you mad,
boss, but--

00:02:57.666 --> 00:03:00.333
We need to retreat! Retreat!

00:03:05.375 --> 00:03:07.000
Hey, they're running away!

00:03:07.083 --> 00:03:10.708
Well then, let's live up to our name
and chase them!

